      "id": "claim_5329c40351e3481c9be09c796edc8b0c",
      "statement": "resolve_github_token routes GitHub token resolution by thread visibility and ownership: for private threads started by the thread owner, it attempts to retrieve that owner's per-user OAuth token from the dashboard store; if the token is not found or revoked, it raises GitHubUserAuthRequired to force re-authentication rather than silently using a bot token. For public threads or private threads not started by the owner, it requests a GitHub App installation token.",
